flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load or create Dataset]
    B --> C{Rows valid and finite?}
    C -- No --> X[Report input error]
    C -- Yes --> D[Create reproducible training and test split]
    D --> E[Choose lambda with k-fold validation on training rows]
    E --> F[Fit scaler on training rows only]
    F --> G[Transform training and test features]
    G --> H[Fit coordinate-descent LASSO]
    H --> I[Predict held-out test targets]
    I --> J[Calculate regression metrics]
    J --> K[Report metrics and selected features]
    K --> L([End])
    X --> L
